/Title (This is a practitioner-drafted voluntary standard, not enacted provincial legislation. It operates as a procurement condition, professional baseline, and policy proposal pending provincial legislative action and formal consultation. It will be revised following structured consultation with First Nations communities, labour, civil society, and the NB technology sector. Where AI systems engage federal jurisdiction, this framework complements, and does not supplant, federal obligations.)
